ndex, no dividends: skipped\n\n=== [3] code exec=17\nfrom data_pipeline.option_equity_historical_data_loader import MassiveHistoricalDataLoader\n\nloader = MassiveHistoricalDataLoader(data_dir=DATA_DIR)\n\nmarket = loader.load_market(\n    dates=\"2026-09-08\",\n    tickers=[\"SPXW\", \"SPX\"],\n)\n\n\n=== [4] code exec=18\nmarket\n...\n</persisted-output>",
